# ============================================================================
# STANDING RULE: the actual conclusive, copyrightable manuscript prose for
# this series lives entirely OUTSIDE this repo, in the sibling folder
# `../official text/Book 1` through `Book 7` (i.e. one level up from this
# repo, alongside it, NOT nested inside it). This repo is the design-
# document/outline layer only (books/, characters/, plot/, etc.) -- fine to
# keep public. Do not move "official text" into this repo, and do not add a
# `text/` folder anywhere in here with real prose in it, without also adding
# it below first. The defensive patterns below are a safety net in case that
# convention ever changes -- see dev-road-map/03-phase-1-foundations.md,
# section "Untrack the Final-Text Folder", and the equivalent convention in
# the CurrentNovelDocs repo (TerranLights/CurrentNovelDocs).
# ============================================================================
